==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~20 seconds<sup>60f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Using meatshields and [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] that outrange Super Metal Hippoe such as [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]], [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] and [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] can make this level much easier. To greatly simplify the level, you can bring [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], then proceed to spam both of them for the entirety of the level, no stalling required. Doing this, it is possible to clear the level in two minutes or less, depending on the frequency of Critical Hits. Due to Crazed Whale and Island's damage, they can both kill Super Metal Hippoe in one hit if they do a Critical.

Certain [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attacking]] critical hitters such as [[Berserker Cat]] and [[Hayabusa (Uber Rare Cat)|Hayabusa]] can trivialize this stage.

